# 4x4x4: inner layers, and solving a short scramble.
cuboid 4x4x4

case 6.1 Drag F second column from the right up
note 2R: the inner layer next to R
wait 0.4
drag F@1,-3,3 F@1,3,3 0.5
settle
expect state 2R

case 6.2 Drag F second row from the bottom right
note 3U': the inner layer next to D, turned like D (= 3U')
reset
wait 0.3
drag F@-3,-1,3 F@3,-1,3 0.5
settle
expect state 3U'

case 6.3 Scramble 5 and solve
note IDA* finds a short solution and plays it back
reset
scramble 5 21
wait 0.5
solve
settle
expect feedback solution
expect solved
